{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues. The baby's name matches a novel narrator. Let me think about \"Zaphod\" (Hitchhiker's Guide narrator is actually the narrator, not Zaphod). Let me think about famous narrators: \"Holden\" (Catcher in the Rye), \"Nick\" (Great Gatsby), \"Scout\" (To Kill a Mockingbird), \"Huck\" (Huckleberry Finn), \"Ishmael\" (Moby Dick), \"Offred\" (Handmaid's Tale), \"Humbert\" (Lolita), \"Lolita\" (Lolita - though Humbert narrates), \"Zaphod\" (Hitchhiker's Guide). Let me search for celebrity babies born in 2021 with these names, and think about the hospital renaming clue more carefully.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"celebrity baby born 2021 named Holden second child same birthday\", \"celebrity baby born 2021 named Scout second child same birthday\", \"celebrity baby born 2021 named Nick second child same birthday\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_a57177dc786145689fbe48b7","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"hospital renamed 2022 after celebrity baby born 2021\", \"Cedars Sinai hospital renamed 2022\", \"Lenox Hill hospital renamed 2022\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_2fa73e4521884337bc189249","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789382091,"id":"chatcmpl-1a40eef6-eaf4-94ca-8ea0-0247328837c2","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":18348,"completion_tokens":276,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":18624,"cached_tokens":1408,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1408},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}